{
  "//": [
    "Recipe sources for the TV compat recipes (docs/COMPAT_RECIPES_PLAN.md). Highest priority first: in auto",
    "mode the first source whose mods are installed and whose items all exist wins.",
    "",
    "materials: the item for each role the TV templates (tvs.json) use. A plain id is an item, '#ns:path' is a",
    "tag. Prefer items: the game checks that items exist before it picks a source, but it can't check tags.",
    "Roles a source doesn't list come from its parent, and from vanilla at the end of the chain.",
    "",
    "Every source except vanilla gets a crafting recipe and a Create sequenced assembly recipe for each TV.",
    "Run 'gradlew :common:generateCompatRecipes' after editing; the output goes to common/src/generated."
  ],
  "sources": [
